      "title": "Soul Machine",
      "gist": "Overblown talk of conscious machines distracts and demeans us, and the silicon rapture revives the Cartesian soul while our real essence is felt aliveness.",
      "question": "Soul — what does the conscious AI myth cost us about understanding ourselves? (a closing reflection)",
      "sourceHeading": "Soul Machine"
    },
